---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy | Legacy Moving Denver";
const description = "Privacy policy for Legacy Moving Denver website. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="container py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-secondary">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8">
        Last Updated: January 23, 2026
      </p>

      <p>
        Legacy Moving Denver ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website www.legacymovingdenver.com.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">1.1 Information You Provide to Us</h3>
      <p>
        We collect information that you voluntarily provide when you:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Request a Quote:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, moving details (origin, destination, move date, home size)</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Us:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, message content</li>
        <li><strong>Submit Feedback:</strong> Name, email, feedback content, ratings</li>
        <li><strong>Book Services:</strong> Billing information, address details, special requests or requirements</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>
        When you visit our website, we automatically collect certain information about your device and browsing activity:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
        <li>Referral source (how you arrived at our website)</li>
        <li>Device information (mobile, desktop, tablet)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">1.3 Analytics Information</h3>
      <p>
        We use basic website analytics to understand how visitors use our site. This includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Page views and website traffic patterns</li>
        <li>Referring websites and sources</li>
        <li>General location data (city/state level only)</li>
        <li>Browser and device type</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Our analytics do not track individuals or collect personally identifiable information. All data is anonymized and aggregated.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the information we collect for the following purposes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Provide Services:</strong> To respond to your quote requests, schedule moves, and provide moving services</li>
        <li><strong>Communication:</strong> To contact you via phone, email, or text message regarding your inquiry or service</li>
        <li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> To assist you with questions, concerns, or service issues</li>
        <li><strong>Service Improvement:</strong> To understand how visitors use our website and improve our services</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> To send you promotional information about our services (you can opt out at any time)</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> To comply with applicable laws and regulations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">3. SMS Consent</h2>
      
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">3.1 SMS Consent for Transactional Information</h3>
      <p>
        By providing your mobile phone number and opting in to receive transactional SMS messages, you consent to the use of your phone number for the purpose of receiving important updates and notifications related to your account and transactions. These transactional SMS messages may include, but are not limited to, alerts about account activity, order confirmations, delivery updates, and other relevant transactional information.
      </p>
      <p>
        Standard messaging rates and data charges from your mobile carrier may apply.
      </p>
      <p>
        To opt-out of receiving transactional SMS messages, simply reply 'STOP' to any message you receive from us. You may also contact us directly at <a href="tel:7203401849" class="text-primary hover:underline">(720) 340-1849</a> or <a href="mailto:info@legacymovingdenver.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@legacymovingdenver.com</a> to withdraw your consent for receiving transactional SMS messages.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
      
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.1 We Do Not Sell Your Information</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.</strong>
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.2 Service Providers</h3>
      <p>
        We may share your information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website and conducting our business:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email Service:</strong> For sending quote confirmations and communications</li>
        <li><strong>Form Processing:</strong> Web3Forms for form submissions (they do not store or sell your data)</li>
        <li><strong>Hosting Provider:</strong> Vercel for website hosting</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Basic website analytics (anonymized, no personal data collected)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These providers are contractually obligated to keep your information confidential and use it only for the services they provide to us.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.3 Legal Requirements</h3>
      <p>
        We may disclose your information if required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities (e.g., a court or government agency).
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>SSL/TLS encryption for data transmission</li>
        <li>Secure servers and hosting infrastructure</li>
        <li>Regular security updates and patches</li>
        <li>Access controls limiting who can view your information</li>
        <li>Regular security audits and monitoring</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">6.1 Access and Correction</h3>
      <p>
        You have the right to access and update your personal information. Contact us at <a href="tel:7203401849" class="text-primary hover:underline">(720) 340-1849</a> or <a href="mailto:info@legacymovingdenver.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@legacymovingdenver.com</a> to request access or corrections.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">6.2 Opt-Out of Marketing</h3>
      <p>
        You can opt out of receiving marketing communications at any time by:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Clicking the "unsubscribe" link in any marketing email</li>
        <li>Calling us at (720) 340-1849</li>
        <li>Emailing us at info@legacymovingdenver.com</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Note: You will still receive transactional communications related to services you've requested (quote confirmations, service updates, etc.).
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">6.3 Data Deletion</h3>
      <p>
        You can request that we delete your personal information by contacting us. We will comply with your request unless we need to retain certain information for legal, regulatory, or business purposes.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">6.4 Do Not Track</h3>
      <p>
        We respect Do Not Track (DNT) signals. Our analytics do not track users across websites or collect personally identifiable information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not use cookies for tracking or advertising purposes.</strong> Our website uses minimal technical cookies only for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Captcha verification (to prevent spam)</li>
        <li>Session management</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not use:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Third-party advertising cookies</li>
        <li>Social media tracking pixels</li>
        <li>Retargeting or remarketing technologies</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Because we use privacy-focused analytics and minimal cookies, <strong>no cookie consent banner is required under GDPR, CCPA, or PECR regulations.</strong>
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites (review sites, social media, etc.). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites. We encourage you to read their privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not directed to individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected information from a child, please contact us immediately.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">10. California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are a California resident, you have additional rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Right to know what personal information we collect, use, and share</li>
        <li>Right to delete your personal information</li>
        <li>Right to opt-out of the sale of personal information (we don't sell your data)</li>
        <li>Right to non-discrimination for exercising your privacy rights</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise these rights, contact us at (720) 340-1849 or info@legacymovingdenver.com.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">12. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us:
      </p>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg mt-4">
        <p class="mb-2"><strong>Legacy Moving Denver</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-2">8805 W. 14th Ave, Suite 300</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Lakewood, CO 80215</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Phone: <a href="tel:7203401849" class="text-primary hover:underline">(720) 340-1849</a></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@legacymovingdenver.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@legacymovingdenver.com</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded">
        <p class="font-semibold text-secondary mb-2">✓ Privacy-First Approach</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          We use privacy-focused analytics (no tracking) and do not sell your data. Your privacy matters to us, and we've built our website with that principle in mind.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
